      <!-- Diagnostic Summary Terminal -->
      <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-gold">
        <h3>Diagnostic Summary</h3>
        <ul class="anu-terminal-list">
          <li><strong>The Factory of Transmutation:</strong> The human Bio-Computer processes three types of food: Physical matter, Air, and Impressions. Mechanical humanity only digests the first two. The Sovereign Operator actively digests the third.</li>
          <li><strong>Hanbledzoin (Astral Blood):</strong> When psychological impressions and sensory data are consciously digested through self-remembering, they undergo a thermodynamic shift, producing a refined energetic substance known as Hanbledzoin.</li>
          <li><strong>Conscious Labor &amp; Intentional Suffering:</strong> You cannot generate Hanbledzoin in a state of comfort. The Athanor requires the deliberate denial of mechanical desires to generate the necessary kinetic friction.</li>
          <li><strong>Crystallization:</strong> Without Hanbledzoin, the Kesdjan (Astral) blueprint remains a phantom that dissipates at death. By flooding this blueprint with synthesized voltage, the Operator crystallizes an immortal vehicle capable of Escape Velocity.</li>
        </ul>
